'''Fried Chicken''' is a {{Common}} [[Sea Creature]] that can only be fished from [[Hotspot]]s on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Fried Chicken''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] on the [[Crimson Isle]] after reaching {{skl|fishing|14}}.

[[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

